// M3 language-boundary negative (): state-machine / lifecycle source syntax is
// FUTURE (L2 in docs/language/LANGUAGE_LEVELS.md), not core grammar. The frontend must reject
// `state` / `transition` with "unexpected statement", not partially accept it.
// See docs/language/LANGUAGE_BOUNDARY.md §3. Pinned by self-test [56].
procedure order_lifecycle {
    input amount : money

    state Open
    transition Open -> Settled on settle
}
